Aniki! Garudamon is causing chaos in the city!

00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:42.230
That's Piyomon! Please, help him!

00:22:42.230 --> 00:22:44.690
He doesn't remember us anymore.

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:46.350
We can't let him get away with this!

00:22:46.350 --> 00:22:47.070
No way!

00:22:47.070 --> 00:22:47.870
Damn it!

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:50.130
Am I not able to protect anyone?

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:51.500
I want to be stronger...

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:53.960
